 61NI c  E({+11}B)=54 MeV from HI-13 tandem facility at CIAE.  Target was 1.0   
 61NI2c  mg/cm{+2} thickness on a 8.9 mg/cm{+2} backing.  Measured E|g, I|g,    
 61NI3c  |g|g, |g|g(|q) using an array consisting of six HPGe anti-Compton      
