 61NI c  Compiler comment: authors list this as a 4n reaction channel,          
 61NI2c  which isn't possible given the beam and target listed.                 
 61NI cL E,J$As given by 2023Li05. Jpi are based on ADO measurements,           
 61NI2cL configuration assignments and comparison to similar bands in           
 61NI3cL neighboring isotopes.                                                  
 61NI cG E$Authors make only a general statement that uncertainties are         
 61NI2cG between 0.2 and 0.6 keV.                                               
 61NI CL BAND(A)$Magnetic rotational band.                                      
 61NI CL BAND(B)$Anti-magnetic rotational band.                                 
 61NI cG $2023Li05 define the ADO (here given as DCO) as I|g(40|')/I|g(90|')    
 61NI2cG with typical values of 1.6 and 0.9 for stretched quadrupole and        
 61NI3cG dipole, respectively.                                                  
